 "kind": "definition",
 "title": "K-injective resolutions",
 "statement": "A complex $I$ of sheaves on an etale site is *K-injective* if for every\nacyclic complex $A$ the complex $\\operatorname{Hom}(A,I)$ is acyclic. A\n*K-injective resolution* of a complex $K$ is a quasi-isomorphism $K\\to I$\nwith $I$ K-injective.",
